      "text": {
        "text": "超愛這家，飯湯無限吃到飽。豬排很好吃，蝦排買一送一。飯醬沙拉醬很搭。\n\nRice and soup are unlimited refill. Rice sauce and salad dressing is provided for you if the food is too dry. Food was decent too.",
